  "what has he shipped on azure?": {
    "answer": "He shipped a document intelligence assistant on Azure. He built a LangGraph agent exposing 14 tools covering document question answering, cross-document comparison, and template-driven generation. He used Azure OpenAI GPT-4o, Azure AI Search, Cosmos DB Gremlin, and Azure Blob Storage. He deployed streaming FastAPI endpoints over Server-Sensed Events with a React single-page app. He architected hybrid retrieval fusing BM25 keyword search with vector search, LLM-based query rewriting, and Cohere re-ranking. He applied PII and entity redaction guardrails across ingested documents. He implemented header-aware chunking, Markdown-header splitting, recursive splitting, SHA-256 deduplication, and metadata handling. He measured 14 tools on one LangGraph agent, hybrid retrieval cost trade-offs, and LLM-as-a-Judge hallucination and retrieval scoring.",
