  "what broke in production and how did he find it?": {
    "answer": "The LangChain deepagents SDK broke with a silent failure that reported success while discarding an error, leaving no exception or stack trace. He found it by reading the code closely enough to see where the system contradicted itself, tracing the problem to a specific code path that was misreporting outcomes. The fix was shipped by a maintainer within 57 hours after he wrote up the issue.",
